THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE LICENSES

This file lists the third-party components distributed with, or linked into,
Arqut Edge Community Edition, together with their licenses.

Arqut Edge ships as a single binary containing two distinct sets of
third-party code:

  1. Go modules compiled into the binary. The list below covers the build
     closure reported by `go list -deps ./...`. Test-only dependencies are
     excluded because they are not distributed.

  2. JavaScript packages bundled into the management UI. The Quasar/Vue
     single-page application is built to ui/dist/spa and embedded into the
     binary (see ui/embed.go), so its production dependencies are
     redistributed and are attributed here. Build-time-only devDependencies
     (linters, formatters, build tooling) are excluded because they are not
     part of the shipped bundle.

None of the components below are licensed under the GPL, LGPL, or AGPL.

